 {{< /note >}}
 
+{{< note >}}
+If you cancel an in-progress rollout by reverting only `spec.requestRollout`
+without also reverting `spec.environmentdImageRef`, the spec image stays ahead
+of the image that environmentd is actually running. In this case, balancerd and
+console continue to track the image of the last completed rollout (recorded in
+`status.lastCompletedRolloutEnvironmentdImageRef`) so that they stay aligned
+with the running environmentd. If you want the spec to reflect the running
+version, revert `spec.environmentdImageRef` as well.
+{{< /note >}}
+
 
